<title>CANADA: IPO PRICING - Fletcher's 1.35 mln at $8.50.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Fletcher's 1.35 mln at $8.50.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Fletcher's Fine Foods Ltd</p>
<p>   Priced At				     $8.50</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	    $8 - $9.50</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			1,350,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter   Pacific Crest Securities</p>
<p>NOTE: The underwriter said that Fletcher's, a Vancouver-based pork processing company, will begin trading on the Nasdaq Market on Friday.</p>
